<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon Late</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon Late</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon Late</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon ii phua la a phabel teng
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na muk taw nong tawp a, nong itna in sapittui sangin thum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pum tungah a namtui na khat om a, na min in tuasia ma phawlo hi. Nang hong it thei ngawl numei om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong pui ta'n a, ih tai tu hi; ka kumpipa hong hi ta'n a, na inndoi sungah hong paipui ta'n. Ih lungdam khawm tu a, nasia tak dawn khawmin, ki itna sungah suakta takin ih omkhawm tu hi. Numei theampo ii nang hong it sia lamdang ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem numeite awng, kei ka ci vom hi, ahihang ka mealpha hi. Kedar ah sennealngam tuipuanbuk bangin vom kaleng Solomon ii kumpi inn sungah puankhaite bangin ka mealpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ciivom hu in, hong nomu heak vun, banghang ziam cile nisa ka thuak hang ahi hi. Ka suapui pate in kei tungah hong thin uuk ahikom sapithuan sungah na hong seamsak hi. Keima le keima ka kipua tu hun ka nga bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng kei hong son ta'n, na ngannote koisungah na tha tu ziam? Sunkim nisa ciang koisungah tawlnga tu ni ziam? Tuucing dangte ii tuuhon kawm ah banghang kong zon kul tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Numei sung pan a ithuaibel awng, a mun he ngawl ni ziam? Pai in tuuhonte zui ta'n; na kealte atu in tuucingte ii buk hui ah lo hingna mun zong ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, Pharaoh ii siphu ngalleang a kai siphutalte a thin a thosak siphupui bangin pasalte thin na thosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sam sia na biangkho tungah hoi niingniang a na ngawng kiim ah suang manphate bangin kibaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang nang atu in khamh khi ngui khat ih vawt tu a ngunn kizepna taw ih zeam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka kumpipa sia a lupna tungah lum a, ka paaknamtui ngim kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ngaino ka awm tungah hong lup ciang myrrh ngimnamtui nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia Engedi sapithuante sungah a palh duisung paakte bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng bangza in na mealpha ziam; na mittangte bangza in ithuai vakil ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kong itbel awng, na etlawm mama a, nong lungkimsak mama hi! Lopa hingte ih lupna hi tu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cedar thingte sia ih inn thulnuai hi a, cypress thingkungte ih innciing dap hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in Sharon ah ngampaak khat ka hi lel a, mualkuam ah unok paak khat ka hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ling kawm a unok paak khat bangin numeite sungah ka it ngaino om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka itbel ka lawmpa sia tangval dangte taw teengat ciang thingtang sungah apple kung khat taw kibang hi. Ama ii limh sungah ka to nuam a, a nga sia thum ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a an neakna innpi sungah kei hong paipui a, itna mai taw hong en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungzuang duangvul ka hikom sapitnga kote taw ka tha hong dimsak ta'n a, apple nga taw hong thak sua ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A baan veisang hong khamhsak a a ziatsang khut taw hong koai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem numeite awng, ka ki itna nong pheltan ngawl natu in a zuanngang sangaite le sazate min lo in kei hong kamciam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngaino ii aw ka za hi. Ama sia mualpi tungah tai kawmin hong pai a, mualnote kaantan in ka kung hong zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia saza khat bang, sangai moi khat bang ahi hi. Ama sia ka innpang kungah ding hi. Ama in kongkha pan puankhaite pailet in inn sung sang hong en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaino in kei hong paupui hi. Ka ngaino awng, hong pai ta'n, ka it ngaino awng hong pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Phalbi bo zo a, nguatui kang zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngam sungah paakte palh hi. Hi hun sia lasak hun hi a, lo sungah vakhute kuul kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theite min tu kipan a, sapit paak ngimnamtui zongh kiza zo hi. Tua ahiciang hong pai ta'n, ka ngaino awng; Kong it ngaino awng hong pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang sia suanghawng kawmah a buu vakhu khat bang na hi hi. A ngaibaang na meal hong musak ta'n a, a lungzuanhuai na aw hong zasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih sapitkungte paak zo ahikom ngia honte ii a lalcipsak ma in ngiano honte man in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia keima aa hi a, keima in ama aa ka hi hi. Ama in a nganhonte unok paak sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />zingvui a vak vahiau ma le khuavak mahiat dong cing hi. Ka it ngaino awng, Bether mual lian tungah a om saza khat le sangai moi khat bangin hong heak kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lupna tungah ka lum a zan simin, ka it ka ngaino ka mang in ka man hi. Ama ka zong a, ahihang ka mu zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi sungah ka vavak a, a lamliante le a lamzinte kaantan in, ka it ka ngaino ka zong hi, ahizong ka mu zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuapi a cing ngalvilte in kei hong mu hi. Amate tungah “Ka ngaino na mu uh ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate ka nusiat po ciang ka ngaino ka mu hi. Ama ka lencip a, ka nu ii inn sung ka suana inndoi sung ka thet pui dong ama ka thasua bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem numeite awng, ko ii ki itna nong pheltan ngawl natu in, a zuanngang sangaite le sazate min lo in kei hong kamciam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sennealngam pan meikhu khuam khat bang, ngimnamtui le sum vawtte ii zuak paaknamtui bang, myrrh thingnaai namtui taw hong pai sia a bang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa a kumpi tokhum tungah to in, kizawng in hong pai hi. Israel ngam a ngalkap phabel sawmlukte in cing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate theampo namsau zak thiam tek hi. Amate sia ngalsim a thiam ngiingeei sa ngalkap luite ahi uh hi. Zanin a sim a om le a do tu in amate namsau khat tek toai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Solomon Kumpipa sia a phabel thing taw a kivawt kumpi tokhum tungah to in, kizawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khuamte sia ngunn taw kizeam a; a tungah khamh taw a kizeam puan kikoi hi. A tophate sia Jerusalem numeite ii itna takpi taw a taa puan sandup taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion numeite awng hong pai tavun a Solomon Kumpipa en vun. Ama in a zi nei ni, a lungdam ni le a thinnop ni in a nu ii a lu tungah a khuksak kumpilukhu sia khu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, na mealpha lawlawm hi! Na mai sealna dial ii nungah a ithuai na mittangte tee vakil hi. Na sam sia Gilead mualpangh suk a, keal hon tai bangin kithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hate sia a mul a kimeet tawm, a kisilthiang tuute bangin paak hi. Khat beak zongh tongh ngawlin kikim diimdiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mukte puansan khaupheang khat bang hi a; na pau ciang bangza in etlawm ziam? Na biangte sia na kisealna dial nungah san sitset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng sia ngalhangte zak lum tulkhat a kikhai zeizoina ngil kilkel in a beam David ii tausaang taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na noaite sia unok paak kawm ah an ne a, a taa khawm saza, apeang sangaite bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in zingvui a vak vahiau mateng le khuavak mahiat dong myrrh thingnaai namtui mual, ngimnamtui mualtung ah ka om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, na mealpha lawlawm a; Paubanna na nei bua hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka angkoai awng, Lebanon mual panin kei hong zui ta'n, Lebanon panin hong zui ta'n, Tawpite le pawlbeamte teenna, Amana Mualdawn, Senir Mualdawn le Hermon Mualdawn panin hong tuaksuk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaino le ka angkoai awng, na mit ha zia le na khi aw ziate in ka thin ka lung hong vut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaino le ka angkoai awng, nong itna in ka thin hong nuamsak hi. Nong itna sia sapittui sangin thum zaw a, na paaknamtui sia a dang hel namtuite sangin namtui zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kong it ngaino awng, na muk sia khuaitui bangin thum a, na leei sia kei atu in, khuinoai le khuaitui ahi hi. Na puansilhte sia Lebanon ii paaknamtui namcinte nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ngaino, ka angkoai sia a kiseal huan, a ki uumcip huan, aituam tuinaak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua munah thingkungte dawngin khang hi. Amate sia talee kung bangin po a, nga pha belte nga hi. Henna thingnamtui, nard thingnaai namtui, saffron, calamus le cinnamon pan kipan thing ngimnamtuite kamh ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah a namtuibel myrrh le aloe te po hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lebanon Mualte panin luamtui a luangsukte le ciktui te in tua huan tui kawtsakin lei zenhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khanglo vun, Saksang vui awng. Thangsang vui awng, ka huan sungah va vun; ngimnamtui taw dimsak vun. Ka ngaino sia ama ii huang sungah hong pai in thingnga a limbel teng ne tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kong it ka ngaino, ka angkoai awng, Ka huan sungah ka tum zo hi. Ka hel namtuite le ka myrrh thingnamtuite khawmtua in; ka khuaitui le ka khuaiphaangte ka ne a; ka sapittui le ka noai ka ne hi. Lawmtate awng, itna taw na kham teakin ne in, dawn vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mut lanin ka thin ciim hi. Ka mang in ka ngaino in kongkha hong king hi. Kong it ngaino, ka vakhu awng, hong tumsak ta'n, ka lu sia daaitui taw kawt a ka sam sia meeizunh taw tuamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nik ka puante suut siat zo khi hi, banghangin silh kik teang kik tu khi ziam? Ka peangte sil zo khi hi, banghangin ninsak kik tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaino in a khut taw kongkha len a, ama hong nai ahikom ka lungpeal ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama tumsak tu in ka kingingta khol zo hi. Kong hon tu ka kipat ciang ka khutte myrrh thingnaai namtui taw, ka khutmete myrrh thingnaai tui taw kizut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngaino kongkha ka hon hi, ahihang ama om nawn ngawl hi. Ama aw za nuam lawlawm ing! Ka zon hang ama ka mu zo bua a, ka biapui hang ama in hong zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuapi a cing, ngalvilte in hong mu a, amate in hong saatin, hong chidupsak hi. Khuapi luphung a cingte in ka lukhu hong eaukeaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem numeite awng, ka ngaino na mu uh le kei sia ama ngai in vul khi hi, ci in nong sonsak natu uh in kamciam kei hong pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Numei theampo sung pan a mealphabel nu awng, na lawmpa sia ngualdang khat po sangin lamdangin, tum pian zaw ziam? Tuabang liang a kamciam kong piak tu uh sia, ama huvau bang a lamdang vahut om na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia etlawm in hat hi; ama sia tulsawm sung pan khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A maitang sia taau bang hi a neal hi; a sam kiil a, va-ak vom bangin vom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mittangte sia luamtui luang khat ii hui ah vakhute bang, noaitui taw kisil a, luihui ah a ding vakhute bangin pha kilkel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biangkhote sia paak le hel namtuite taw a kidim huan khat bangin etlawm hi. A mukte sia myrrh thingnamtui tui taw a kawt dikdek unok paakte taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A khutte sia a et hoi a pha in piang a, ama in suangmanpha khutzungbute bun hi. A pumpi sia suangmanpha taw a kizeam saiha neal taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pheizangte sia khamh tungah a kingaa suangngo khuamte taw kibang hi. Ama sia kumpi mealpu a, Cedar kung saang pona Lebanon mualte bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kampaute thum a, zaak nop huai mama hi. A kampaute ih nial tu khat mama zongh om ngawl hi. Jerusalem numeite awng, ka ngaino sia hi bang teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A mealphabel numei awng, na it na lawmpa koi sungah pai ziam? Na mu natu kong hu thei natu uh in bang lampi tawn ziam, hong son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia balsam thing pona mun a huan sungah pai zo hi, Ama in a tuu honte a huan sungah tha a, unok paakte lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngaino sia keima aa hi a, keima in ama aa ka hi hi. Ama in a tuu honte unok paak sungah tha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, nang sia Tirzah bangin na mealpha a, Jerusalem khuapi bangin ithuai in, hi khuapi liante bangin na mealphatna in husan ngawngawn hong tawpsak tha liang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mittangte kei sang panin heam in, tuate in kei hong cimawsak hi. Na samte sia Gilead mual pangh suk ah keal honte tai valet bangin kithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hate sia a kisilthiang tuu honte bangin paak hi. Khat beak zongh a peuhe om ngawlin kikim diimdiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mai sealna dial nungah na biangkhote san sitset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in zi sawmluk, zino sawmliat, a kisim zo ngawl ngaknu moi nei tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang keima in khat bek ka it a, ama sia vakhu khat bangin ithuai hi. Ama sia a nu ii tanu khat bek a nei hi a, a nu ii a it mama tanu ahi hi. Numei theampo in ama en in pok uh hi; a zi le a zinote in ama pokna lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingsang khuavak taw a kibang hisia nu akua ziam? Ama a mealpha a, taang hiihee a, ni bang tha bangin tee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngamkuam sungah thingnote en tu, sapitkung tungah a teeno suakte en tu le talee kung tungah a paakte en tu in Almond kungte sungah ka paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siphu ngalleang hawlpa ii ngal sim tu lawpin a liin bangin nang kong it hu in ka liing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Shulam ngaknu awng, laam in, laam in, Na lap kong en tu uh hi. A ngual a ngual a hong en te ii kilaklaw ah ka lap sia banghangin hong en nuam nu ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang sia a tuanngen ngaknu khat na hi hi! Na peangdap sungah na peangte hoi lawlawm hi. Na pheizangte phatzia sia limsuai thiamte ii limsuai taw kibang hilhel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kamh ngeingawl sapittui namtui kuang khat tua munah om hi. Mangtaang vawng khat tua munah om a, unok paakte in kiim uum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na noaite sia a taa khawm vahel apeang sangai, a omkhawm vahel saza nii taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng sia saiha tausaang khat taw kibang hi. Na mitte sia Heshbon khuapi kongpi hui ah a om tuicingte bang ahi hi. Na naak sia, Damascus khua a cing Lebanon tausaang bangin ithuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lutang sia Carmel Mual bangin saangto kiukiau hi. Na sam kipheakte sia naipuan cii phabelte bangin tee vasip a; ama ii phatna in kumpipa ii mit le thin suu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na mealpha mama a, hoi lawlawm nii hi; Nong itna in ka lung hong kimsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Palm thingkung khat bangin na ngaibaang a, na noaite sia date nga bom kaaite bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Palm kung khat tungah kaato in a nga ka lo tu hi. Kei atu in na noaite sia sapit bom bang hi a, na ngim sia apple min bang namtui in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na muk sia sapittui phabel taw kibang hi. Tua ahile sapittui sia ka ngaino kungah luang tahen a, a muk le a ha khuum tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaino neisa ka hi a, ama in dik hong sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kong it ngaino awng, hong pai ta'n a, ngam sungah pai in khuanote ah zan ngiak tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingtuung in ih tho tu a sapitkungte, a khang ziam, paakte a palh ziam, talee kungte a paak ziam ih en tu hi. Tua munah kong itna kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mandrakes dei aikung ngim namtui na za tu a, tuaciang thingnga lim theampo sia ih kongbiang hui ah om tu hi. Kong it ngaino awng, thingnga a lui le a thak nang atu in kong khealsiasak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang sia ka nu ii a noai taw a vaak ka suapuipa hi lete kong oai hi. Tua hile lampi ah kisi in kong namh zong kuama in hong awlmawk ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nu ii inn ah hong ciapui leng a ki itna zia hong hil lete uuk ing. Na neak tu in sapittui namtui le talee tui kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na baan veisang nong khamhsak a, na ziatsang khut taw nong koai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem numeite awng, ka ki itna uh nong pheltan ngawl natu uh in kei kamciam hong pia tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sennealngam panin a lawmpa taw a kikoai sa in hong pai sia akua ziam? Na suana mun ahi apple kung nuai pan, nang kong phong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima simngawl kuama dang it heak in a, keima simngawl kuama dang koai heak in. Ki itna sia thina bangza in vaanglian a, kingaina zongh thina za in kho hi. Ki itna sia mei bangin kuang a, kaanghmei bangin lengkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ki itna meikuang sia tui in tulmit zo ngawl a, namthuam in khuum zo ngawl hi. Ahizong khat po in a hauna taw ki itna lei a sawm le simmawkna bek nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suapui numeino khat ka nei uh a, a noaite no lai hi. Tangvalno khat hong pai in ama a heal ciang ka suapuinu atu bang vawt tu khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama luphung khat hile ngunn tausaang khat ka saksak tu uh hi. Ahizong ama kongpi khat hi le cedar thing pheakte taw ka dal tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in luphung ka hi a, ka noaite sia a tausaangte ahi hi. Ka ngaino in ama taw lungkimna le thinnopna ka nei sia he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Baal Hamon a kicina munah Solomon in sapithuan khat nei hi. Ama tung pan lo a saap lotho pawlkhat om hi, amate khat simin ngunn dangka tulkhat tek pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon awng na ngunn dangkatang tulkhat la in a, lothote tungah amate tel tu a zaa nii pia in. Kei ka hi le keima aituam sapit huan khat ka nei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, huan sung panin na aw hong zasak ta'n, ka kithol puite in na pauna aw za tu in hong ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngaino awng, saza khat bangin, hel namtuite pona mualtung ah a om, sangaital moi khat bangin ka kungah hong pai ta'n.
  </para>
</usx>
